  "title": "Chef John's White Gazpacho",
  "description": "Chef John's chilled puréed white gazpacho soup recipe includes cucumbers, grapes, almonds, and bread cubes. It's an elegant first course on a summer day.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
